  "id": "lemony-cream-of-chicken-soup",
  "name": "Lemony Cream of Chicken Soup",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken soup brightened with lemon",
  "description": "A simple chicken and rice soup made creamy with chicken soup and finished with lemon juice.",
